title: v1 schema lock + multi-track timeline + carousel/image kinds
summary: 'Locked the v1 .atelier schema in one session: AudioVisual replaces State.audio; kind: video|image|carousel + design block + slides[] added; Timeline summary block becomes a writer-derived top-level field; compose-video-project rewritten to support multi-clip with lazy track-video-1 Group, slug-based clip IDs, parented captions in clip-local time, and one-to-one asset/layer mapping that eliminates orphan-asset accumulation. Renderer now applies the nearest ancestor VideoVisual''s startFrame to delta evaluation so captions parented to a clip follow when the clip moves on the timeline.'
